# Pipeline projects — one per line: <repo-root> [bar-label]
# The label shows next to the glyph in the menu bar; defaults to the first
# two letters of the repo name. Read by bin/statusbar.30s.sh.
#
# Copy to projects.conf (untracked) — or let bin/add-project.sh register
# projects for you.
#
# /Users/you/projects/my-repo mr
